`verilator_config
// Waivers for linting a testbench harness alone (scripts/check-harness.mjs), on top of the
// common waivers. Nothing else passes this file (SV guide, section 8).
//
// A checker latches its first mismatch in err_* registers (VectorChecker in ts/src/tb/, and the
// checkers built like it). Nothing inside the harness reads them: SimTop prints them by
// hierarchical reference when the check fails, and an FPGA build would read them back the same
// way. A lint of the harness alone sees them as unused, so this waives exactly that warning for
// exactly those names.
lint_off -rule UNUSEDSIGNAL -file "*" -match "Signal is not used: 'err_*'"
